  (1098782, 281, 9124, '#ItB #LoveToBuild #habis #bincang soal BESI BETON di @Waru.Agung #AyoKumpul sama @SINGGIH_Mr_The_Yes salurkan hobi lama #TourDeCiak di @Java.Dancer Jalan Jakarta #Malang ... • STRIPLOIN STEAK WITH MUSHROOM SAUCE & SMASHED POTATOES (8/10) • CAPPUCINO (8/10) • WAMENA YAMA COFFEE (8/10)', 4, NULL, '#ItB #LoveToBuild #habis #bincang soal BESI BETON di @Waru.Agung #AyoKumpul sama @SINGGIH_Mr_The_Yes salurkan hobi lama #TourDeCiak di @Java.Dancer Jalan Jakarta #Malang ... • STRIPLOIN STEAK WITH MUSHROOM SAUCE & SMASHED POTATOES (8/10) • CAPPUCINO (8/10) • WAMENA YAMA COFFEE (8/10)', 1),
