  (1099113, 203, 21321, 'Price point-nya merepresentasikan tempatnya yang di tengah kota. Standard industrial style coffee shop. Ada colokan di lt. 2. I ordered one of their teas (Cold Be Gone?) and it tastes like wedang uwuh. I usually like wedang uwuh, but this one is a very diluted version of it.', 3, NULL, 'Price point-nya merepresentasikan tempatnya yang di tengah kota. Standard industrial style coffee shop. Ada colokan di lt. 2. I ordered one of their teas (Cold Be Gone?) and it tastes like wedang uwuh. I usually like wedang uwuh, but this one is a very diluted version of it.', 1),
